msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>The anxious Yok Huy appears to be at her wit's end."
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Синхронизация задания</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Тревожная йок-хуй, похоже, не знает, что делать."

#. ja: 苛立った様子のチーワグーの一族に「なだめる」をする
#. de: Den verärgerten Salzgrubenarbeiter beruhigen
#. fr: <i>/apaiser</i> le Yok Huy de Chirwagur exaspéré
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_TODO_00:1"
msgid "/soothe the ill-tempered saltworker."
msgstr "/утихомирить вспыльчивого соледобытчика."

#. ja: チャットの「Say」モードで『ゴオルカーリョー』を含む言葉を入力し<br>苛立った様子のチーワグーの一族に呼びかける
#. de: Im „Sagen“-Chatmodus „Gorrl Karryor“ zu dem verärgerten Salzgrubenarbeiter sagen
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, saisir une phrase contenant “Gorrl Karryor” pour interpeller le Yok Huy de Chirwagur exaspéré
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_TODO_01:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, enter any phrase containing “Gorrl Karryor” to call out to the ill-tempered saltworker."
msgstr "В режиме чата <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Сказать</ui-edge-color></ui-color> введите любую фразу со словами «Gorrl Karryor», чтобы окликнуть вспыльчивого соледобытчика."

#. ja: 心配そうなヨカフイ族と話す
#. de: Mit der besorgten Yok Huy sprechen
#. fr: Parler à la Yok Huy anxieuse
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Speak with the anxious Yok Huy."
msgstr "Поговорить с тревожной йок-хуй."

#. ja: ああ、お客人……手を貸してくれませんか？<br>チーワグー塩田へ塩の取引に向かった友人が帰ってこなくて。
#. de: Oh, <if $gn4>edle Besucherin<else>edler Besucher</if>, würdest du mir vielleicht deine Hilfe zukommen lassen? Ein Freund, der zum Salzhandel zu den Salzgruben der Chirwagur aufbrach, ist wider Erwarten noch nicht zurückgekehrt.
#. fr: Excusez-moi, pourriez-vous me venir en AIDE<nbsp>? Un de mes amis est allé NÉGOCIER avec ceux du salin de Chirwagur, et il n'est toujours pas revenu...
#. speaker: ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048_000_000:1"
msgid "Gods, what if they kill him? You there, visitor─I need a favor. A friend of mine left to barter with the Chirwagur, and he's still not back yet!"
msgstr "Боги, вдруг его убьют? Эй, гость, мне нужна помощь. Мой друг отправился торговаться с Чирвагур, а до сих пор не вернулся!"

#. ja: チーワグー塩田の者たちは、作った塩を、<br>力を誇示して売りつけてくることで知られてるわ。<br>それも、恐ろしいほどの暴利で……。
#. de: Die Händler an den Salinen sind dafür bekannt, dass sie das von ihnen gewonnene Salz unter Androhung von Gewalt verkaufen, und das zu einem fürchterlichen Wucherpreis.
#. fr: Ces voyous sont connus pour leurs pratiques proches de l'EXTORSION<nbsp>: en clair, ils nous forcent à acheter le sel qu'ils produisent à grand renfort d'INTIMIDATIONS voire de MENACES.
#. speaker: ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048_000_002:1"
msgid "Those saltworkers are notorious for their aggressive sales tactics, not to mention their exorbitant rates. It's criminal!"
msgstr "Эти соледобытчики славятся напористыми методами торговли, да ещё и цены заламывают до небес. Просто преступление!"

#. ja: 友人も交渉の際は、腕利きの仲間と一緒に向かっていたけど、<br>今は動ける武人もいなくて、仕方なくひとりで塩田へ……。
#. de: Bei den Ver<shy>hand<shy>lungen hatte mein Freund geschickte Gefährten an seiner Seite, doch nun, da keine kampffähigen Krieger zur Verfügung stehen, ist er notgedrungen allein losgezogen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Quand arrive l'heure des négociations, mon ami se fait généralement accompagner d'un garde du village. Mais AUCUN n'était disponible cette fois, malheureusement...
#. speaker: ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048_000_003:1"
msgid "Normally he takes a combat-capable friend along with him, but this time he had no choice but to go alone... Suffice it to say, I'm dreading the worst!"
msgstr "Обычно он берёт с собой друга, который умеет сражаться, но на этот раз ему пришлось идти одному... Боюсь худшего!"

#. ja: お願い、もしも友人が塩田の者たちと揉めていたら、<br>まずは相手を「なだめて」くれないかしら！
#. de: Ich bitte dich, sollte mein Freund mit den Händlern dort in Streit geraten sein, könntest du versuchen, ihre Gemüter zu beruhigen?
#. fr: Je vous en prie, essayez de le rattraper<nbsp>! Et si jamais il est aux prises avec l'un de ces LOUBARDS, tâcher D'<i>APAISER</i> ce dernier sans user de violence<nbsp>!
#. speaker: ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048_000_005:1"
msgid "If you happen to see any saltworkers hassling my poor friend, would you attempt to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>soothe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> them? They're generally more forgiving of transgressions from those outside our culture."
msgstr "Если увидите, что соледобытчики пристают к моему бедному другу, попробуйте их <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>успокоить</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. К чужакам они обычно снисходительнее."

#. ja: それでももしダメなら、「ゴオルカーリョー」と伝えてほしい。<br>これは古くから伝わるヨカフイ族の言葉……<br>彼らもきっと耳を傾けてくれるはずよ。
#. de: Sollte es dennoch nicht gelingen, so sprich „Gorrl Karryor“ - seit alters her überlieferte Worte der Yok Huy<nbsp>... Gewiss werden sie dir dann Gehör schenken.
#. fr: En dernier recours, prononcez ces mots<nbsp>: “Gorrl Karryor”. C'est une expression en langue ancienne yok huy qui devrait faire son PETIT EFFET... Bonne chance<nbsp>!
#. speaker: ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048_000_006:1"
msgid "Failing that, try telling them “Gorrl Karryor.” I'm sure they will listen to words of the ancient tongue."
msgstr "А если не поможет, скажите им: «Gorrl Karryor». Уверена, слова на древнем языке они выслушают."

#. ja: 友人が塩田の者たちと揉めていたら、まずは相手を「なだめて」、<br>それでもダメなら、「ゴオルカーリョー」と伝えてちょうだい！
#. de: Sollte mein Freund mit den Händlern an den Salinen in Streit geraten sein, so versuche bitte zuerst, die Gemüter zu beruhigen. Und sollte dies vergebens sein, sprich folgende Worte: „Gorrl Karryor“!
#. fr: Si mon ami est aux prises avec l'un de ces LOUBARDS, tâcher d'abord D'<i>APAISER</i> ce dernier sans user de violence. Si ça ne fonctionne pas, prononcez les mots “Gorrl Karryor” et voyez sa réaction.
#. speaker: ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_ANXIOUSYOKFUY05048_000_0010:1"
msgid "If you happen to see any of those saltworkers harassing my poor friend, please do try to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>soothe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> them! If they won't listen, just say “Gorrl Karryor”!"
msgstr "Если увидите, что соледобытчики пристают к моему бедному другу, попробуйте их <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>успокоить</ui-edge-color></ui-color>! А если не послушают, скажите: «Gorrl Karryor»!"

#. ja: 君は……いや、今はそれどころじゃないんだ。<br>話がこじれてしまって……<br>よければ、君も彼を「なだめて」くれないか？
#. de: Du<nbsp>... kommst zu einem denkbar schlechten Zeitpunkt. Unser Gespräch hat eine unglückliche Wendung genommen. Könntest du mir vielleicht helfen, ihn zu beruhigen?
#. fr: Qui es-tu<nbsp>? Enfin, peu importe. J'essaie de discuter calmement, mais mon interlocuteur est en train de MONTER DANS LES TOURS... Est-ce que par hasard, tu pourrais lui dire quelques mots pour l'<i>apaiser</i><nbsp>?
#. speaker: NEGOTIATORYOKFUY05048
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_NEGOTIATORYOKFUY05048_000_011:1"
msgid "Who are you!? On second thought, that can wait. Listen, I've talked myself into a corner─can you try to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>soothe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> this saltworker before I lose a limb?"
msgstr "Ты кто такой!? Хотя не до того сейчас. Я тут так запутался в переговорах... Не поможешь <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>успокоить</ui-edge-color></ui-color> этого соледобытчика, пока он мне чего-нибудь не оторвал?"

#. ja: ウオォ……！<br>テメェ……舐める、な……！！
#. de: Uuooh<nbsp>... Du<nbsp>... wage es nicht, mich gering zu schätzen!
#. fr: Grouoooh<nbsp>! TOI respecter MOI, sinon...<nbsp>!!
#. speaker: CHIRWAGURYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_CHIRWAGURYOKFUY05048_000_020:1"
msgid "Gwoooh! Show respect, weasel-worm!"
msgstr "Гррр! Ты, червяк, уважай меня!"

#. ja: こちらに気がつく様子すらない……。<br>まずはエモート「なだめる」をして落ち着かせよう。
#. de: Er scheint dich nicht einmal zu bemerken. Versuche zunächst, ihn zu beruhigen (Emote: Beruhigen; Textbefehl: /ruhig).
#. fr: Le Yok Huy de Chirwagur est si énervé qu'il ne vous remarque même pas... Essayez malgré tout de l'<i>apaiser</i>.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_SYSTEM_000_021:1"
msgid "The saltworker does not appear to have noticed you. Perhaps it's time you stepped in to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>soothe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> him."
msgstr "Соледобытчик, кажется, вас не заметил. Пора вмешаться и <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>успокоить</ui-edge-color></ui-color> его."

#. ja: ハァ……小さき、者……？
#. de: Hm? Was will das kleine Wesen?
#. fr: Hmmm<nbsp>? PETIT ÊTRE vouloir quoi...<nbsp>?
#. speaker: CHIRWAGURYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_CHIRWAGURYOKFUY05048_000_022:1"
msgid "Hmm? Who is this puny outsider?"
msgstr "Хм? Кто этот слабак-чужак?"

#. ja: 関係、ない……！<br>まず、テメェ、ブッ殺す……！！
#. de: Es ist nicht von Belang<nbsp>... Zuerst werde ich dich niederstrecken!
#. fr: Moi pas me laisser distraire<nbsp>! Moi CORRIGER insolent maintenant<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CHIRWAGURYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_CHIRWAGURYOKFUY05048_000_023:1"
msgid "Little one will not interfere! First, I rip this one in half!"
msgstr "Маленький не вмешиваться! Сначала я разорвать этого!"

#. ja: ヒ、ヒィィ……どうすれば落ち着いてくれるんだ？
#. de: W-Wie kann man ihn nur beruhigen?
#. fr: Oh là là... Si je ne trouve pas vite un moyen de le calmer, je suis FICHU...
#. speaker: NEGOTIATORYOKFUY05048
msgctxt "quest/050/KinGzb108_05048:TEXT_KINGZB108_05048_NEGOTIATORYOKFUY05048_000_024:1"
msgid "Please, no, not in half! How can I get him to listen to reason!?"
msgstr "Нет, пожалуйста, только не разрывай! Как же заставить его слушать!?"

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで、<br>『ゴオルカーリョー』を含む好きな言葉を入力しましょう。
#. de: Gib im Chat-Modus „Sagen“ entweder über die Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur „Gorrl Karryor“ ein, um den verärgerten Salzgrubenarbeiter zu besänftigen.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour saisir une phrase contenant “Gorrl Karryor”, et interpeller le Yok Huy de Chirwagur exaspéré.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
